The '''Bloodsail Retreat''' is a camp of the [[Bloodsail Buccaneers]] found on the eastern coast of [[Jaguero Isle]] in [[Stranglethorn Vale]]. Admiral [[Garfield Sparkblast]] and his crew have moored their ship here, looking for more crewmates to join them.

